// NARDOK'S COUNTER. Old School's own figures: ten bone spears and five bone daggers, restocking
// every 12 seconds, which is 20 ticks.
//
// TWO ROWS AND NOT FOUR. This build also has a bone club and bone bolts, and he sells neither -
// the club is a drop and the bolts come from elsewhere, exactly as in Old School. A shop that
// stocks everything sharing a word in its name is how a drop stops being worth getting.
//
// allstock=no, so an empty counter cannot be used to turn any old item into coins. The prices come
// from the objs themselves - 600 and 2000, which already match - so nothing is priced twice here.
[nardok_shop]
scope=shared
size=2
restock=yes
allstock=no
stock1=cave_goblin_bone_spear,10,20
stock2=bone_dagger,5,20
